++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
|GKB                        MONK HELP
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

This command provides access to the guilds help
files. All powers and skills have help files, as well as
many other monk related topics. A list of topics can be gained
by reading the topics help file. 

